<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Sunday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Patrick Baur (Germany) 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-1</p>
</text>
